        "id": 87674,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-26T14:30:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Apart from that little whoopsie of, from the sounds of it, putting Chastise on a charcater card, you can get around losing your stuff to End of Days if Unity has a Bee Bot out - when End of Days triggers, destroy everything that you don't want hanging around, then destroy Bee Bot - Bee Bot's destruction momentarily interrupts End of Days and may destroy an ongoing card. So destroy End of Days, cutting off its effect before it can take out any other hero cards (plus any useful environment cards which may be in play, like Police Back-Up or whatever). That way, everyone gets to keep their stuff apart from that one Bee Bot. It's like your own version of Devastating Aurora :D.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:12:01.726Z",
