        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/danmarshall14/{size}/1944_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-28T14:26:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Those \"whoops\" moments definitely happen, especially when you're new to the game.&nbsp; I remember when my friends and I thought Lead From the Front could redirect Environment damage as well and with Danger Sense out, we were using Legacy to completely shut down the environment.&nbsp; So we just sat there in Atlantis, letting all the villains get crushed by damage while it just pinged off Legacy.&nbsp; Upon a&nbsp;second reading of the card, we realized that this was not kosher :)</p>",
