        "id": 87677,
        "name": "Odin",
        "username": "Odin",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/odin/{size}/2572_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-29T18:14:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I love playing The Dreamer!! Half the time I feel like there is no hope and this little girl is owning my team and the other half of the time I feel like I can beat her as long as i don't mess up (then vilanous weaponry and two dark heroes pop up). She is the villain that I have the most even record against.</p><p>My whoops moment had to do with getting Ra set up with solar flare + staff + Imbued fire + Flesh of the sun god. i had two games where I just destroyed the villain and then i looked up the rules for solar flare and realized what just happened.</p>",
